			description: [
				"&7How to get one:&r You need &6iron ingots&r first — with &bProgressiveStages&r, iron and this recipe stay hidden in &eJEI&r until you unlock &6Iron Age&r (smelt iron ore for the vanilla story advancement). Then &6craft&r a &6Harpoon Gun&r: &73 iron ingots&r top row, &7string · tripwire hook · string&r middle, &7stick&r under the hook. In creative, grab one from the &eTools and Utilities&r tab."
				""
				"&7How to use it:&r In the &bfloating-islands overworld&r, &euse&r (right-click) while aiming at &esolid blocks on an island&r to place the &efirst anchor&r. Use again on a &edifferent island&r within range to finish a &erope link&r. Messages above the hotbar explain if something blocked the shot."
				""
				"&7Rules in short:&r new links must stay on your &estarter island network&r (your hub plus a ring of neighbors unless the server enables deeper hops). If the &esecond&r shot fails a rule, the &efirst&r anchor is cleared so you can try elsewhere."
			]
